>Kv
aṅgīkṛtyātmano duḥkhaṃ sukhayaty aparān mahān | ātapād ātapastho 'yaṃ pathikān avati drumaḥ || 104 ||
>VpŚ2
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhayate param || hlādayan_ tāpitān_ vṛkṣo duḥkhañ ca sahate svayam
>VpŚ2d
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhayate param | hlādayann āśritān_ vṛkṣo duḥkhañ ca sahate svayam ||”
>VpŚ
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhayate paraṃ || hlādayan_ tāpitān_ vṛkṣo duḥkhañ ca sahate svayaṃ |
>VpŚd
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhayate paraṃ | hlādayann āśritān_ vṛkṣo duḥkhañ ca sahate svayaṃ ||
>VpBh
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhāyate param || 63 || hlādayaty āśritān vṛkṣo duḥkhaṃ ca sahate svayam |
>VpBh-A
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhāyate param || 63 || hlādayaty āyitān vṛkṣo duḥkhaṃ ca vasate svayam |
>VpBh-B
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhāyate param || 63 || hlādayaty āśritān vṛkṣo duḥkhaṃ ca sahate svayam |
>VpBh-C
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhāyate param || 63 || hlādayaty āśritān vṛkṣo duḥkhaṃ ca sahate svayam |
>VpBh-D
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhāyate param || 63 || hlādayaty āśritān vṛkṣo duḥkhaṃ ca sahate svayam |
>VpV
ātmānaṃ pīḍayitvāpi sādhuḥ sukhayate param | hlādayann āśritān vṛkṣo duḥkhañ ca sahate svayam”
